AB  - The proceedings contain 58 papers. The topics discussed include: rank critical success factors (CSFs) of data warehouse and business intelligence (DW/BI) implementation in banking sector using analytical hierarchy process (AHP); lexicon addition effect on lexicon-based of Indonesian sentiment analysis on Twitter; a review of skills relevant to enterprise resource planning implementation projects; mechanics, dynamics, and aesthetics framework on gamification at university; qualitative analysis: acceptance of android-based augmented reality technology using a mixture of marker and markerless methods as a product differentiation strategy; Diffie Hellman algorithm for securing medical record data encryption keys; a review of skills relevant to enterprise resource planning implementation projects; and improvement of decision tree classifier accuracy for healthcare insurance fraud prediction by using extreme gradient boosting algorithm.
